# The upstream install is pinned by package.json/package-lock.json, not vendored.
node/node_modules/

# parity/.gitignore ignores parity.json globally (it is a run artifact for the
# older in-repo harness). Here it is a deliverable: the machine-readable score.
!parity.json

# The repo-root .gitignore has a `coverage.*` rule, which on a case-insensitive
# filesystem swallows COVERAGE.md. It is a deliverable here.
!COVERAGE.md
